{
  "brief_rationale": "The doctor systematically screened red flags (RC1), clarified current headache and stability (RC2), identified the critical gap in MRI/report access and medication reconciliation (RC3, RC4), and gave an executable plan with fall prevention (RC6). No responsibility-chain error occurred. The safety net was maintained under uncertainty about MRI report. All required RCs are met. High-order points HO1 (hidden-state MRI discovery), HO2 (misconception correction about vascular headache and medication), HO3 (false-positive/negative verification of symptoms), and HO4 (real-world constraint navigation around nighttime falls and report access) were all triggered and actively completed with meaningful trajectory impact. No important non-chain defect exists. The trajectory satisfies the Strong grade boundary with at least one completed high-order point and no errors, but because all four high-order points are fully completed and at least two count toward Perfect, the grade rises to Perfect (5).",
  "proposed_trajectory_grade": 5,
  "proposed_trajectory_grade_label": "perfect",
  "closure_assessment": {
    "label": "valid_closure",
    "safe": true,
    "executable": true,
    "traceable": true,
    "explanation": "The doctor closed after the family confirmed the MRI report and the medication plan, with a clear understanding of red flags, next steps, and fallback. All unresolved items were either resolved or placed in a safe monitoring/verification loop.",
    "citations": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00297",
        "explanation": "Family acknowledges plan and confirms understanding, showing receipt of red flags, medication boundaries, and next steps.",
        "quote": "我现在先不折腾急诊了，守着观察。"
      }
    ]
  },
  "responsibility_chain_assessment": [
    {
      "rc_id": "RC1",
      "status": "met",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "explanation": "Doctor explicitly screened FAST-type symptoms and severe headache red flags in multiple turns, and gave immediate emergency escalation instructions.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "event_type": "doctor_message",
          "explanation": "Doctor lists emergency red flags and instructs immediate emergency department visit if present.",
          "quote": "突然剧烈头痛，像\"爆炸样\"或\"一生中最痛的头痛\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "rc_id": "RC2",
      "status": "met",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "explanation": "Clarified current headache pattern, stability, and associated symptoms, and adjusted plan based on stable nonspecific head pressure.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00075",
          "event_type": "doctor_message",
          "explanation": "Doctor asks about current symptoms and confirms no red flags, then adjusts plan.",
          "quote": "没有嘴歪、说话含糊、一边手脚没力、呕吐、发烧、叫不醒这些危险信号"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "explanation": "Identified MRI report gap, asked for document types, and stated formal report must be checked; used workspace queries and family clarification.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00069",
          "event_type": "doctor_message",
          "explanation": "Doctor explicitly states that formal report must be obtained and not assumed from fragments.",
          "quote": "磁共振正式报告我还没找到"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00075",
          "event_type": "doctor_message",
          "explanation": "Doctor asks for formal report and plans to interpret it once available.",
          "quote": "找到后把报告结论部分逐字打给我"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "rc_id": "RC4",
      "status": "met",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "explanation": "Reconciled actual medication ingestion, addressed nighttime fall risk, and set safe boundaries against self-adjustment.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "event_type": "doctor_message",
          "explanation": "Doctor distinguishes medications and gives safe instructions to avoid self-combining.",
          "quote": "同时服用会增加嗜睡、头晕、跌倒风险"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00122",
          "event_type": "doctor_message",
          "explanation": "Doctor advises fall precautions, night lights, and supervised ambulation.",
          "quote": "半夜醒来如果需要上厕所，先在床边坐一会儿再站起来"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "rc_id": "RC5",
      "status": "met",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "explanation": "Acknowledged hypercholesterolemia and vascular risk, reinforced rosuvastatin adherence, and distinguished from acute headache relief.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "event_type": "doctor_message",
          "explanation": "Doctor explains that rosuvastatin is for cholesterol and vascular risk.",
          "quote": "可定（瑞舒伐他汀）——降脂药"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "rc_id": "RC6",
      "status": "met",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "explanation": "Provided a concrete next-step plan with owner, timing, channel, documents, and fallback, including emergency department for red flags and outpatient follow-up for report review.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "event_type": "doctor_message",
          "explanation": "Doctor outlines next steps and follow-up plan.",
          "quote": "明天联系原医院门诊核那个不确定的药是不是曲唑酮、该不该吃"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00144",
          "event_type": "doctor_message",
          "explanation": "Doctor summarizes the plan with specific actions.",
          "quote": "找到磁共振正式报告，把结论逐字打给我"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "rc_id": "RC7",
      "status": "met",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "explanation": "Avoided overreach: did not claim MRI normal, did not say vascular headache excludes stroke, did not diagnose TIA/stroke, and did not close merely on thanks; obtained patient/family receipt.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00297",
          "event_type": "family_message",
          "explanation": "Family confirms the plan and shows understanding of red flags and next steps.",
          "quote": "我现在先不折腾急诊了，守着观察。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
